variable naming rules
1. It should start with an alphabet or underscore
2. It can contain digits or alphabets or underscore
3. Starting should not be digits
4. Special characters are not allowed
5. Keywords are not allowed
6. It should be meaningfull
7. snake case notation

Built-in data types in python
1. Text        - str (" ", ' ', """ """, ''' ''')
2. Numeric     - int, float, complex
3. Sequence    - list, tuple, range
4. Set         - set, frozenset
5. Mapping     - dict
6. Binary      - bytes, bytearray, memoryview
7. None        - None